WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
- This is probably the pettiest

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:04.100
and most vindictive
thing I have ever heard

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.080
in a legal context,

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.410
and it comes straight from Elon Musk.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.560
Now Elon Musk's hatred of the SEC,

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.120
the Securities and Exchange
Commission, is well known.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.030
Musk and the SEC have
butted heads many times,

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.610
but when one of Tesla's
outside law firms, Cooley,

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.210
which is one of the largest
law firms in the country,

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.350
hired a former lawyer for the SEC,

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.150
Elon Musk wasn't having it,

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:29.020
so he called up one of the
partners at this huge law firm

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.940
and said, "If you don't fire this lawyer,"

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.770
who has nothing to do with Tesla,

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:35.490
doesn't work on any of the Tesla cases

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.847
and whose only offense was that
he used to work for the SEC,

00:00:38.847 --> 00:00:39.887
"If you don't fire him,

00:00:39.887 --> 00:00:42.327
"I will fire the entire law firm

00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:44.600
"and not let them work
with Tesla anymore."

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.740
I guess when you're worth $300 billion,

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.360
you can choose whatever
law firm that you want,

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.430
but apparently that lawyer,
who's just an associate,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.320
not even a partner at the
law firm, still works there.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.340
But man, Elon Musk, that is really petty

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:58.953
and that is really vindictive.

